    "preamble": "A.Samuthiram vs The District Collector on 5 August, 2022",
    "facts": "2. According to the writ petitioner, the fourth respondent is running a factory in the residential zone and it is causing pollution in the said locality. 4. The fourth respondent has also obtained the licence for the period covered from 2021 to 2022. 5. The writ petitioner has given a representation to the authorities of the Pollution Control Board.",
    "arguments": "7. The learned Additional Government Pleader appearing for the official respondents would submit that an inspection was conducted by the second respondent herein and they have recorded that the fourth respondent is not using cashew nut shell for burning and he is only using firewood for burning.",
